6 , worship of God, but Est 3:2 (twice in verse); 3:5 in obeisance to Haman. 2 bow down , of the couching lion Gen 49:9 ; Num 24:9 (both poetry). 3 pregnant with על , bow down over (in order to lie with) a woman Job 31:10 . 4 bow down , of a woman in childbirth 1Sam 4:19 , so of animals Job 39:3 ; idols, removed by enemies Isa 46:1-2 , כֹּרְעוֺת בִּרְכַּיִם Job 4:4 tottering (feeble) knees; of enemies in death, נפל [ ו ] כרע bow and fall down Judg 5:27 (3 t. in verse); Psa 20:9 pregnant without נפל 2Kin 9:24 ; Isa 65:12 , with תַּחַת 10:4 . &#8212; Hiph`il Perfect 3masculine singular הִכְרִיעַ Psa 78:31 ; 2 feminine singular suffix הִכְרַעְתִּנִי Judg 11:35 ; Imperfect 2masculine singular תַּכְרִיעַ 2Sam 22:40 = Psa 18:40 ; Imperative suffix הַכְרִיעֵהוּ 17:13 ; Infinitive absolute הַכְרֵעַ Judg 11:35 . &#8212; 1 cause to bow in grief Judg 11:35 (twice in verse). 2 cause to bow down in death Psa 17:13 ; 78:31 , with תַּחַת 2Sam 22:40 = Psa 18:40 .","rootNote":"a primitive root;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Kgs 8 54","keyReferences":["1Kgs 8 54","1Kgs 19 18","1Sam 4 19","2Chr 7 3","2Chr 29 29","2Kgs 1 13","2Kgs 9 24","2Sam 22 40"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":36,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Kgs 8 54","book":"1Kgs","chapter":8,"verse":54,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִ/כְּרֹ֣עַ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Vqc"},{"reference":"1Kgs 19 18","book":"1Kgs","chapter":19,"verse":18,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כָֽרְעוּ֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqp3cp"},{"reference":"1Sam 4 19","book":"1Sam","chapter":4,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/תִּכְרַ֣ע","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqw3fs"},{"reference":"2Chr 7 3","book":"2Chr","chapter":7,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יִּכְרְעוּ֩","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqw3mp"},{"reference":"2Chr 29 29","book":"2Chr","chapter":29,"verse":29,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כָּרְע֗וּ